DBT COMPUTE EXECUTION: ARCHITECTURE & COST COMPARISON
Fargate | ECS/EC2 Multitenant | ECS/EC2 Single-tenant | Cosmos dbt + Astronomer
Executive Management Review — April 2026
Prepared by: Risk Finance & Treasury

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
1. PURPOSE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

This document provides a neutral, quantified comparison of four compute
execution options for dbt workloads to support architecture and finance
decision-making by senior management. All numbers are derived from POC
assumptions and will change if run duration, task size, concurrency, or
instance sizing changes.

