7. HYBRID OPTION (If Required)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

A hybrid approach is possible and often used in practice:
- ECS/EC2 Multitenant  → steady, predictable workloads (best unit economics)
- Fargate              → burst workloads (elastic spikes / irregular tenants)
- Cosmos + Astronomer  → rapid onboarding with zero infra investment
- ECS/EC2 Single-tenant→ high-compliance tenants needing dedicated infra

